title: "Dynamics of mutators of arbitrary dominance in humans: analysis code"
abstract: >-
  A population genetic model of germline mutation rate modifiers ("mutators")
  with arbitrary dominance, with the forward simulations, effect-size estimates
  and likelihood analyses behind the paper.
